 "about": [
  "The paths inside an addon package and the root of a working folder (11-catalog-distribution.md 3.4).",
  "excluded: the things of a repo checkout and of the launcher at the ROOT of a working folder (.git is both: the folder of a clone, the file of a git worktree or submodule) that are never a part of the package, compared in lower case (only at the root, a folder by the dir list, a file by the file list). Launcher addon_author.rs EXCLUDED_DIRS / EXCLUDED_FILES (author mode: check, pack), validator gwcat/package.py EXCLUDED_DIRS / EXCLUDED_FILES (gw_catalog.py / gw_addon_tool.py validate and pack of a folder). A zip of a release is the package itself: nothing is left out of it.",
  "root: one entry at its place in an empty working folder (dir - a folder with a file in it); excluded - left out of the files of the package.",
  "names: a posix path of a file of the package (a zip entry, or a file of a folder). expect: ok or the code of the error - package_backslash, package_absolute_path, package_bad_path (an empty, '.' or '..' component), package_windows_name (< > : \" | ? *, a control character - Unicode Cc: U+0000-U+001F, U+007F-U+009F -, a trailing dot or space, a device name: CON PRN AUX NUL CONIN$ CONOUT$ COM0-9 LPT0-9 and COM/LPT with the superscript 1 2 3, compared without case with the part before the first dot, trailing spaces cut). warning: package_long_path over 200 characters. Validator gwcat/package.py _check_name, launcher addon_author.rs check_name; the windows-name rule is the installer's unpack.rs is_portable_path (a package it refuses must not pass the catalog)."
 ],
